<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/control-result/CONFORMING> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/control-result> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/control-result> ; skos:notation "CONFORMING" ; skos:prefLabel "Conforming"@en ; skos:definition "All assessment criteria met for the claim type, evidence >= profile floor"@en .
