  skos:hasTopConcept <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM0>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM1>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM2>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM3>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM4>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM5> .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM0> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:notation "IM0" ; skos:prefLabel "Absent"@en ; skos:definition "The practice is not performed, or there is no evidence that it is"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM1> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:notation "IM1" ; skos:prefLabel "Initial"@en ; skos:definition "Performed ad hoc or reactively; depends on specific individuals; inconsistent; little or no documentation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM2> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:notation "IM2" ; skos:prefLabel "Defined"@en ; skos:definition "Documented, approved and owned; scope and responsibilities stated; not yet consistently implemented across the declared scope"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM3> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:notation "IM3" ; skos:prefLabel "Implemented"@en ; skos:definition "Implemented across the declared scope; records exist and reconcile to the definition; gaps known and tracked"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM4> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:notation "IM4" ; skos:prefLabel "Operating"@en ; skos:definition "Operates consistently over a representative period and relevant states; measured; exceptions detected and handled"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity/IM5> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/implementation-maturity> ; skos:notation "IM5" ; skos:prefLabel "Optimised"@en ; skos:definition "Measured against objectives and improved through incidents, tests, exercises and independent challenge; improvements demonstrated"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state> a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Gate result"@en ; dcterms:source "registries/vocabularies/gate-results.csv" ;
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/PASS>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/FAIL>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/UNKNOWN>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/APPROVED_NA>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/NOT_ASSESSED> .
