<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/UNKNOWN> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state> ; skos:notation "UNKNOWN" ; skos:prefLabel "Unknown"@en ; skos:definition "No FAIL condition, but an in-scope CRITICAL control is UNKNOWN or NOT_ASSESSED, gate evidence is below floor, or a US4 UNKNOWN is attached"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/APPROVED_NA> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state> ; skos:notation "APPROVED_NA" ; skos:prefLabel "Approved na"@en ; skos:definition "Gate not applicable to the declared scope, with approved boundary rationale"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state/NOT_ASSESSED> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/gate-state> ; skos:notation "NOT_ASSESSED" ; skos:prefLabel "Not assessed"@en ; skos:definition "Applicable gate not yet evaluated"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Decision state"@en ; dcterms:source "registries/vocabularies/decision-states.csv" ;
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/REASONABLY_ASSURED>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/CONDITIONALLY_ASSURED>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/LIMITED>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/NOT_ASSURED>, <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/INCONCLUSIVE> .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/REASONABLY_ASSURED> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:notation "REASONABLY_ASSURED" ; skos:prefLabel "Reasonably assured"@en ; skos:definition "Sufficient appropriate evidence supports the bounded top claim; all applicable gates PASS or APPROVED_NA; no undisposed US3 or higher UNKNOWN"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/CONDITIONALLY_ASSURED> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:notation "CONDITIONALLY_ASSURED" ; skos:prefLabel "Conditionally assured"@en ; skos:definition "Bounded top claim supported subject to named, owned, time-bound conditions; no gate FAIL or UNKNOWN"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/LIMITED> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:notation "LIMITED" ; skos:prefLabel "Limited"@en ; skos:definition "Some sub-claims supported; material limitations, a gate UNKNOWN, or a gate FAIL whose AIDCF-010 ceiling is LIMITED prevent a broader conclusion"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/NOT_ASSURED> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:notation "NOT_ASSURED" ; skos:prefLabel "Not assured"@en ; skos:definition "Evidence demonstrates that the top claim, or a controlling gate, is not met"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state/INCONCLUSIVE> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/decision-state> ; skos:notation "INCONCLUSIVE" ; skos:prefLabel "Inconclusive"@en ; skos:definition "Evidence, method, boundary or definition cannot support any determination"@en .
