<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/HAS_OUTCOME> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "HAS_OUTCOME" ; skos:prefLabel "Has outcome"@en ; skos:definition "The capability instance is required to achieve the target service outcome."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/REQUIRES_FUNCTION> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "REQUIRES_FUNCTION" ; skos:prefLabel "Requires function"@en ; skos:definition "Achieving the outcome requires the target function to be delivered."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/IMPLEMENTED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "IMPLEMENTED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Implemented by"@en ; skos:definition "The function, or the safeguard, is realised by the target architecture element."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/COMPOSED_OF> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "COMPOSED_OF" ; skos:prefLabel "Composed of"@en ; skos:definition "Whole-part structure: the source contains the target as a constituent. Acyclic."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/CONNECTS_TO> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "CONNECTS_TO" ; skos:prefLabel "Connects to"@en ; skos:definition "The source is an endpoint of the target interface. Physical or logical connection only; implies no dependency, causality or reachability."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/CONSUMES_RESOURCE> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "CONSUMES_RESOURCE" ; skos:prefLabel "Consumes resource"@en ; skos:definition "The source draws on the target constrained resource (power, cooling, water, fuel, space, accelerator capacity)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/DEPENDS_ON> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "DEPENDS_ON" ; skos:prefLabel "Depends on"@en ; skos:definition "The source relies on the target to perform its function; each edge references exactly one Dependency record carrying type, strength and states."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/SHARES_FAULT_DOMAIN_WITH> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "SHARES_FAULT_DOMAIN_WITH" ; skos:prefLabel "Shares fault domain with"@en ; skos:definition "Source and target are members of the same FaultDomain and can fail together from its common cause. Symmetric; each edge references the FaultDomain record."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/LOCATED_IN> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "LOCATED_IN" ; skos:prefLabel "Located in"@en ; skos:definition "The source is physically or logically placed in the target location."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/OPERATED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "OPERATED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Operated by"@en ; skos:definition "The target party holds operational responsibility for the source."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/CONTROLLED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "CONTROLLED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Controlled by"@en ; skos:definition "The target control system or actor can command the source's state or setpoints."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/MONITORED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "MONITORED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Monitored by"@en ; skos:definition "The target observes the source and is relied on to detect its condition."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/PROTECTED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "PROTECTED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Protected by"@en ; skos:definition "The target safeguard acts to prevent, detect, contain, correct or recover from failure of, or harm to, the source."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/EXPOSED_TO> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "EXPOSED_TO" ; skos:prefLabel "Exposed to"@en ; skos:definition "The source is credibly susceptible to the target threat, hazard or failure mode."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/INITIATES> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "INITIATES" ; skos:prefLabel "Initiates"@en ; skos:definition "The threat, hazard or failure mode is the initiating source of the target scenario."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/PROPAGATES_TO> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "PROPAGATES_TO" ; skos:prefLabel "Propagates to"@en ; skos:definition "Within a named scenario, failure of the source causes failure or degradation of the target; carries scenarioRef and step ordinal."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/RECOVERS_THROUGH> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "RECOVERS_THROUGH" ; skos:prefLabel "Recovers through"@en ; skos:definition "The source is restored to tolerance by means of the target recovery path, alternate capacity or recovery safeguard."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/GOVERNED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "GOVERNED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Governed by"@en ; skos:definition "The source is subject to the requirements, method or disclosure rule of the target."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/HAS_EVIDENCE_REQUIREMENT> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "HAS_EVIDENCE_REQUIREMENT" ; skos:prefLabel "Has evidence requirement"@en ; skos:definition "The control or gate requires the target evidence requirement for a stated claim type."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/EVIDENCED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "EVIDENCED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Evidenced by"@en ; skos:definition "The source is offered the target evidence. Records that evidence was presented, not that it is sufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/SUPPORTS> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "SUPPORTS" ; skos:prefLabel "Supports"@en ; skos:definition "After review, the source evidence corroborates the target claim."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/CHALLENGES> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "CHALLENGES" ; skos:prefLabel "Challenges"@en ; skos:definition "The source contradicts or undermines the target claim (defeater). Alias: DISPUTES."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/QUALIFIES> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "QUALIFIES" ; skos:prefLabel "Qualifies"@en ; skos:definition "The source limits the scope, states or conditions under which the target claim holds, without contradicting it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/ASSESSED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "ASSESSED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Assessed by"@en ; skos:definition "The control is assessed, for one claim type in one scope, by the target control assessment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/RESULTS_IN> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "RESULTS_IN" ; skos:prefLabel "Results in"@en ; skos:definition "Execution of the procedure, sample or test produced (contributes to) the target control assessment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/HAS_FINDING> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "HAS_FINDING" ; skos:prefLabel "Has finding"@en ; skos:definition "The source result or gate evaluation records the target finding."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/HAS_UNKNOWN> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "HAS_UNKNOWN" ; skos:prefLabel "Has unknown"@en ; skos:definition "The source has a material undetermined fact recorded by the target UNKNOWN record."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/EVALUATES_GATE> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "EVALUATES_GATE" ; skos:prefLabel "Evaluates gate"@en ; skos:definition "Control to CriticalGate: registry gate mapping, mandatory attribute gateRole (CRITICAL or SUPPORTING). ControlAssessment to GateResult: the result is an input to that gate evaluation. GateResult to CriticalGate: the result evaluates that gate."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/CONSTRAINS> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "CONSTRAINS" ; skos:prefLabel "Constrains"@en ; skos:definition "The source imposes a ceiling, condition, limitation or band withholding on the target. Attribute constraintType: CEILING, CONDITION, LIMITATION, BAND_WITHHELD, GATE_EFFECT."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/SUMMARISED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "SUMMARISED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Summarised by"@en ; skos:definition "The source results are aggregated into the target score snapshot or recommendation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/RECOMMENDS> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "RECOMMENDS" ; skos:prefLabel "Recommends"@en ; skos:definition "The recommendation proposes the decision state and conditions taken up (or departed from, with reasons) by the target decision."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/REVIEWED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "REVIEWED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Reviewed by"@en ; skos:definition "The source record has been reviewed in the target review record."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/APPROVED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "APPROVED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Approved by"@en ; skos:definition "The source record has been approved by the authority recorded in the target review record (reviewType APPROVAL)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/REPORTED_IN> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "REPORTED_IN" ; skos:prefLabel "Reported in"@en ; skos:definition "The source is disclosed in the target report."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/REQUIRES_ACTION> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "REQUIRES_ACTION" ; skos:prefLabel "Requires action"@en ; skos:definition "The source requires the target action to be completed (remediation, evidence collection, decision condition)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/CLOSED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "CLOSED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Closed by"@en ; skos:definition "The source is closed by the target closure evidence, reassessment result or review."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/INVALIDATED_BY> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "INVALIDATED_BY" ; skos:prefLabel "Invalidated by"@en ; skos:definition "The source can no longer be relied on because of the target event (evidence expiry, configuration drift, incident, test failure)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/TRIGGERS_REASSESSMENT> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "TRIGGERS_REASSESSMENT" ; skos:prefLabel "Triggers reassessment"@en ; skos:definition "The source event or trigger rule requires reassessment of the target."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/SUPERSEDES> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "SUPERSEDES" ; skos:prefLabel "Supersedes"@en ; skos:definition "The source replaces the target record of the same class; the target is retained with status SUPERSEDED. Acyclic."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/MIGRATED_FROM> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "MIGRATED_FROM" ; skos:prefLabel "Migrated from"@en ; skos:definition "The source was produced from the target (prior version, legacy vocabulary or legacy record) by the migration recorded in migrationRef."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type/INTEGRATION_HANDOFF> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/aidcf/vocab/relationship-type> ; skos:notation "INTEGRATION_HANDOFF" ; skos:prefLabel "Integration handoff"@en ; skos:definition "The source AIDCF record is exchanged with the AI Trust Graph through the target reviewed handoff record (AIDCF-005)."@en .

